    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a very intense way to put it. But if we follow that logic, aren't we just saying that any powerful nation can decide for itself which governments are \"tyrants\" and then use that as a reason to invade? It seems like you're dismissing the entire concept of international law and state autonomy as \"abstract,\" which feels like it just leaves the world in a state of constant, unchecked warfare based on whoever has the biggest military.",
